  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package thick-cut bacon",
    "1 (16 ounce) package penne pasta",
    "0.33333334326744 cup olive oil",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "3 tablespoons minced garlic",
    "3 teaspoons ground black pepper, divided",
    "3 skinless, boneless chicken breasts, sliced",
    "2 cups heavy whipping cream",
    "1 cup grated Parmesan-Romano cheese blend",
    "1 cup shredded Colby Jack cheese blend",
    "3 eggs, beaten"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E7_tPBoYl_aNkskcxMZJOujUE4Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-277129-four-cheese-chicken-carbonara-VAT-step-01-388fd313679247a4b57f65d9a31ab76d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277129/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bacon in a large skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oT1Ve72kG-O1MRpP4hBmMxJa3e8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-277129-four-cheese-chicken-carbonara-VAT-step-02-f5fa7553c42d4a66bfe86a03f591fd9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277129/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain bacon slices on paper towels. Chop into small pieces when cool enough to handle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V2cyTlygKcJZ1xA-rsZJj_Ry6fM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-277129-four-cheese-chicken-carbonara-VAT-step-03-cd03677162074bb3a8546cfe0ec201c2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277129/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add penne and olive oil; cook, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-54yKjfP_iU5OQYHlafxtxG8vdk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-277129-four-cheese-chicken-carbonara-VAT-step-04-5358efcc57c74182af85de8df5faae3b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277129/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While pasta is cooking, melt butter in a large, deep skillet over low heat. Add chopped bacon, garlic, and 1 teaspoon pepper; sauté until fragrant, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y7q48Ki-PwbQAAu8NXPNaLu31u4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-277129-four-cheese-chicken-carbonara-VAT-step-05-96d58b82a313469c873d2da3a9ce02a7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277129/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increase heat to medium, add chicken, and cook until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7ziIBijjKUDQnWuU9_wCIQsvRE4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-277129-four-cheese-chicken-carbonara-VAT-step-06-5c22f391f5504570bbf319aa1b5ee785.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277129/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add whipping cream, Parmesan-Romano cheese, and remaining 2 teaspoons pepper to the skillet. Stir and cook until heated through, about 3 minutes. Add Colby-Jack cheese and stir until melted. Stir in beaten eggs and bring to a simmer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YhQsj-PhBteXJJGpQBXeg3iy_Jw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-277129-four-cheese-chicken-carbonara-VAT-step-07-0d422e94bfd4482ea9a9a2bb7a19cc0b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277129/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add drained pasta and stir until coated with sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vwhgwpuAS_CIiLzxH5LGs-qUM74=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-277129-four-cheese-chicken-carbonara-VAT-step-08-9836571287234f47ac59362621334210.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277129/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
